  "_about": "Prank gadgets. mode: projectile (flies straight-ish and hits the first thing), thrown (an arc that lands and splashes an area), place (put down at your feet, triggers when someone steps on it). Effects: soaked, slipped, blinded, embarrassed (seconds in 'effects'). onHit / onLand / onTrigger say what happens: effect, knock (push in m/s), signals (sent where it lands: type, range, color, chance). Friendly fire is always on. A new gadget is a new entry here: no code. triggerSound: the sound when someone steps on a placed gadget (default slip_whee).",
